@* The Nexus BJJ mark: an N whose corners are nodes, with the diagonal running
   behind the two uprights so it reads as a strap threaded through them.

   Inlined rather than an <img src="~/img/brand/nexus-mark.svg"> because an SVG
   loaded through <img> is its own document and cannot see the page's colours.
   Inline, `currentColor` resolves against whatever this sits in: white on the
   auth page's blue disc, blue in the navbar. The standalone file is kept for
   anything outside the app (patches, social avatars).

   No dimensions here on purpose. Callers size it in CSS, which keeps the two
   use sites from having to agree on a number. *@
<svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"
     xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M11.9 10.4 52.1 53.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M18 47V17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <path d="M46 47V17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <circle cx="18" cy="47" r="7" fill="currentColor" />
    <circle cx="18" cy="17" r="7" fill="currentColor" />
    <circle cx="46" cy="47" r="7" fill="currentColor" />
    <circle cx="46" cy="17" r="7" fill="currentColor" />
</svg>
